    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This well positioned three bedroom detached bungalow is situated on a generous circa 0.27 acre site within a quiet cul-de-sac development of just eight homes, offering a peaceful residential setting while being only one minute from Mooncoin village and its excellent range of local amenities.\r\n\r\nMooncoin provides a convenient selection of everyday amenities including a local bar and restaurant, primary school and GAA club, while Waterford City and Carrick-on-Suir are both within approximately a 15 minute drive, making this an ideal location for commuters and those seeking the benefits of village living with excellent accessibility.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, comfortable sitting room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, home office, three bedrooms including a master bedroom with en suite, and a family shower room.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from generous off street parking to the front, providing ample space for a number of vehicles. To the rear, a sizeable low maintenance yard offers an excellent outdoor space for dining, entertaining and relaxation. A substantial block-built shed provides valuable additional storage.\r\n\r\nFurther features include double-glazed windows and oil-fired central heating.\r\n\r\nOffering generous accommodation, excellent outdoor space and a superb location within easy reach of Mooncoin village and Waterford City, this property represents an excellent opportunity for families, first-time buyers or those seeking a comfortable home in a peaceful yet highly convenient setting.\r\n\r\nViewings can be arranged trough Sole Agents Barry Murphy Auctioneers\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 1.4m x 1.8m. Tiled floor. \r\nSitting Room: 3.79m x 7.29m. Laminate floor, blinds, fireplace, fitted units. \r\nKitchen/Diner: 4.57m x 5.65m. Lino floor, fitted kitchen with integrated oven & hob. \r\nUtility Room: 2.16m x 2.52m. Lino floor, fitted units, plumbed for washing machine. \r\nOffice: 4m x 2.52m. Lino floor, blinds. \r\nBedroom 1: 4.48m x 4.58m. Laminate floor, fitted wardrobes. \r\nEn-suite: 1.22m x 2.2m. Link floor, tiled walls, WC, wash hand basin, electric shower. \r\nBedroom 2: 3.95m x 2.72m. Laminate floor, fitted wardrobe. \r\nBedroom 3: 2.8m x 3.02m. Laminate floor, fitted wardrobe. \r\nBathroom: 2.75m x 1.79m. Fully tiled, WC, wash hand basin with vanity unit, electric shower."
      },
      {
